WEBVTT

00:47:58.642 --> 00:48:01.748
But we like to cover things
that have press conferences. (Laughs)

00:48:01.772 --> 00:48:02.923
It's easier.

00:48:02.947 --> 00:48:05.035
And then, at the moment,
we're all caught up

00:48:05.059 --> 00:48:08.039
in the national soap opera
of Donald Trump's brain.

00:48:08.063 --> 00:48:10.945
And if you want to write a column
that'll get a lot of views,

00:48:10.969 --> 00:48:12.897
you write about how bad Donald Trump is,

00:48:12.921 --> 00:48:16.097
and readers and viewers seem
to have a limitless appetite for that.

00:48:16.121 --> 00:48:20.228
But I do think it's just a gigantic
distraction to what's actually shaping

00:48:20.252 --> 00:48:22.235
and what's actually happening in America.

00:48:22.259 --> 00:48:24.290
CA: I mean, that's a riddle that plays out

00:48:24.314 --> 00:48:27.658
in quite a painful way across
all social media online,

00:48:27.682 --> 00:48:30.234
that there appears to be a frustrating gap